# NOTE: public/data/*.json is deliberately NOT ignored.
# These are the trained model artefacts (model_ts.json ~1.4 MB) and the statutory
# evidence index (~23 MB). The policy API reads them from disk at request time,
# and Vercel deploys from git, so ignoring them would ship a build whose search
# endpoint returns vailable:false. Regenerate with:
#   ml/build_corpus.py -> ml/train_model.py -> ml/export_bundle.py -> ml/install_assets.py
# Working corpus and training artefacts: 154 MB corpus.jsonl plus intermediate
# models. Regenerate with ml/build_corpus.py. The deployable subset is copied
# into public/data/ by ml/install_assets.py and IS tracked.
ml/data/

# Parity harness scratch input, regenerated by scripts/parity-policy-model.ts
scripts/.parity-input.json
